## 🛠️ Projects I'm Proud Of

### 🔐 Steganography App (MERN + Web3)
Securely encode and decode hidden messages in images, extended to store them on the Aptos blockchain for decentralized and tamper-proof usage.  
**Stack**: React, Node.js, TypeScript, TailwindCSS, Aptos Blockchain

### 🧳 Overseas – Student Accommodation Platform
Full-stack platform that connects students with verified listings, with features like JWT-based authentication, real-time messaging, and dynamic search.  
**Stack**: Next.js, MongoDB, Node.js, Tailwind CSS, Redux Toolkit

### 🧠 Mental Wellness Mobile App
A React Native app built in a hackathon to promote mental health via interactive journaling and mindfulness exercises.  
**Stack**: React Native

### 🇮🇳 Indian Railways Chatbot Revamp
Revamped UI and built an intuitive Kanban admin panel for a chatbot system built for Indian Railways during a Smart India Hackathon.

